and the romance.

00:03:29.074 --> 00:03:30.509
-Yeah.
-So, girl gives up on love.

00:03:30.509 --> 00:03:32.311
-On life?
-No. Love.

00:03:32.311 --> 00:03:33.846
-Oh.

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:36.381
I thought the convicts --
-Gives up on love.

00:03:36.381 --> 00:03:38.184
-Love. Yes.
-Gives up on love.

00:03:38.184 --> 00:03:40.152
Moves to New York City
to be alone.

00:03:40.152 --> 00:03:42.322
So she meets a pretty girl
on the subway.

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:44.557
-Ooh!

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:47.493
-Except the girl on the subway
is trapped in a time warp.

00:03:47.493 --> 00:03:49.529
[ Laughter ]

00:03:49.529 --> 00:03:52.131
-Oh, damn. That makes it --
-No, it's like a magical book.

00:03:52.131 --> 00:03:53.765
-Yeah. I like it.

00:03:53.765 --> 00:03:57.436
-She's trapped in the 1970s.
-Oh, a lot of people --

00:03:57.436 --> 00:03:59.138
