into the 70s?

00:04:04.177 --> 00:04:06.311
-No. There's a little spark,
a little romance.

00:04:06.311 --> 00:04:08.748
-[ Gasps ]
-Just saying.

00:04:08.748 --> 00:04:10.649
What do you want to do?
Oh, you can save me.

00:04:10.649 --> 00:04:12.017
-Or come with me
to the '70s.

00:04:12.017 --> 00:04:13.486
-Come with me,
live in the '70s.

00:04:13.486 --> 00:04:14.854
-Yeah.
-I don't know.

00:04:14.854 --> 00:04:16.822
This could go anywhere.
It's a summer read.

00:04:16.822 --> 00:04:18.658
Sitting on the beach
reading this thing.

00:04:18.658 --> 00:04:21.260
You know how cool you'll look?
-Yes. Totally --

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:23.963
Oh, man, you're cool.
-Thanks.

00:04:23.963 --> 00:04:25.598
-Hey, you're cool!
-Mind your own business.

00:04:25.598 --> 00:04:27.333
Mind your own business.
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:28.901
-Hey, are you reading
"One Last Stop"?

00:04:28.901 --> 00:04:30.436
-Yeah, I am!
-You're cool!

00:04:30.436 --> 00:04:32.405
