00:04:35.241 --> 00:04:37.843
-No, that's not --
That's a different book.

00:04:37.843 --> 00:04:40.446
-'70s.
-All right.

00:04:40.446 --> 00:04:42.215
So, that's that book.
"One Last Stop."

00:04:42.215 --> 00:04:43.582
Here we go.
-[ Applause ]

00:04:43.582 --> 00:04:47.086
That one got applause.
-Yeah, that did.

00:04:47.086 --> 00:04:49.855
-This one is
"Crying in H Mart"...

00:04:49.855 --> 00:04:52.057
