helped shape who she is today.

00:05:29.862 --> 00:05:32.665
-Oh, that got me.
That got me.

00:05:32.665 --> 00:05:34.032
-Right? That got you
right there.

00:05:34.032 --> 00:05:35.300
-Oh, that did get me.

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:36.668
